      "card_id": "johnny-silverhand-never-stop-fighting",
      "card_name": "Johnny Silverhand: Never Stop Fighting",
      "variant": "Beta Iconic Rare",
      "section": "Welcome to Night City Card Errata",
      "heading": "Johnny Silverhand: Never Stop Fighting (Beta Iconic Rare)",
      "text": "The Beta Iconic Rare variant of *Johnny Silverhand: Never Stop Fighting* was erroneously printed with the Eurodollar \u201cSell\u201d tag. Consistent with all other versions of *Johnny Silverhand: Never Stop Fighting*, this card cannot be sold for an Eddie during gameplay.",
